            "review_title": "Review at The Never Ending Summer",
            "review_text": "Josh\n10 contributions\n0\nBest pasta and salad I've had in Vietnam so far\nNov 2019 • Friends\nWhat should I say, I didn't expect a more \"western style\" restaurant like this in the middle of District 10. \n\nBut I am happy that we found it, because their food is so delicious. The atmosphere is cozy, the staff very friendly and the food speaks for itself. \n\nBIG PLUS: Metal straws. Thank you guys for helping save the environment!\nRead more\nWritten November 22, 2019",
